{"step_index":2702,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-27T12:54:12Z","input_tokens":183246,"cache_read_tokens":0,"output_tokens":3055,"content":"# Phase 7 Implementation Report: 10-Stage Beginner DSA Roadmap\n\nI have implemented and verified **Phase 7: Build a Beginner Roadmap** inside your **Teach Me This Code** DSA learning platform.\n\nThe roadmap provides a structured progression from Python fundamentals to advanced competitive data structures. It gives learners the freedom to **skip stages, revisit concepts anytime, jump to any problem, and designate their own active focus stage** without artificial locks, paywalls, or AI dependencies.\n\n---\n\n## 1. The 10-Stage Learning Order & Curriculum\n\nThe 10 stages cover **all 30 topics** in the curated catalog.\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  S1[\"Stage 1: Python Fundamentals & Arrays<br/><i>(Arrays • Slicing • In-place Swapping)</i>\"]\n  S2[\"Stage 2: Strings & Hashing<br/><i>(Strings • Hash Maps • Frequency Dictionaries)</i>\"]\n  S3[\"Stage 3: Two Pointers & Sliding Windows<br/><i>(Converging Pointers • Dynamic Window Horizons)</i>\"]\n  S4[\"Stage 4: Prefix Sums, Sorting & Binary Search<br/><i>(O(1) Range Queries • O(log n) Halving)</i>\"]\n  S5[\"Stage 5: Linked Lists, Stacks & Queues<br/><i>(Pointers • LIFO Matching • Monotonic Stacks)</i>\"]\n  S6[\"Stage 6: Recursion & Backtracking<br/><i>(Call Stacks • Decision Trees • Branch Pruning)</i>\"]\n  S7[\"Stage 7: Trees & Binary Search Trees<br/><i>(DFS/BFS • BST Invariants • Prefix Tries)</i>\"]\n  S8[\"Stage 8: Heaps & Graphs<br/><i>(Priority Queues • BFS Shortest Path • Topological Sort)</i>\"]\n  S9[\"Stage 9: Greedy Algorithms & Dynamic Programming<br/><i>(Memoization • Tabulation • Kadane's Algorithm)</i>\"]\n  S10[\"Stage 10: Advanced Patterns & Data Structures<br/><i>(Bitwise XOR • 2D Matrices • Composite LRU Cache)</i>\"]\n\n  S1 --> S2 --> S3 --> S4 --> S5 --> S6 --> S7 --> S8 --> S9 --> S10\n```\n\n| Stage | Title & Focus | Constituent Topics | Core Milestone Problem | Handpicked Starter Problems |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Stage 1** | **Python fundamentals and arrays** | Arrays | **Two Sum** (LC 1) | Two Sum (`#1`), Contains Duplicate (`\n<truncated 5812 bytes>\n, `.roadmap-jump-pill`, `.card-active-focus`, `.stage-status-badge`, `.stage-concepts-box`, `.stage-milestone-banner`, `.overview-focus-banner`, and `.stage-highlight-pulse`.\n3. [test_dsa_phase7_roadmap.js](file:///C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef/scratch/test_dsa_phase7_roadmap.js):\n   - Comprehensive test suite covering structure, topic coverage, navigation freedom, completion rules, filter synchronization, and visualizer output verification.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Verification & Test Execution Results\n\nAll 8 test suites passed with **100% success**:\n\n| Test Suite | Purpose | Tests / Result |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **test_dsa_phase7_roadmap.js** | 10 stages, suggested order, completion rules, navigation freedom, milestone verification, Kadane output | **31 / 31 Passed (100%)** |\n| **test_dsa_phase6_solutions.js** | Dual-approach solutions, Big-$O$, offline verification, explanation cards | **2,863 / 2,863 Passed (100%)** |\n| **test_dsa_phase5_workspace.js** | Dedicated workspace (Understand, Pattern, Editor, Visualize), test runner | **101 / 101 Passed (100%)** |\n| **test_dsa_phase4.js** | Search, multi-topic, difficulty, status, sorting, pagination, import duplicate prevention | **43 / 43 Passed (100%)** |\n| **test_dsa_phase3.js** | 300 curated problems, schemas, complexity, starter codes, URLs | **17 / 17 Passed (100%)** |\n| **test_dsa_phase2.js** | 30 topic pages, difficulty distributions, category chips | **40 / 40 Passed (100%)** |\n| **test_dsa_phase1.js** | Dashboard metrics, continue learning, recent sessions, roadmap overview card | **31 / 31 Passed (100%)** |\n| **test_phase5.js** | Code visualizer execution engine, variable tracking, step navigation, Kadane verification | **100% Passed (Output = 6)** |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Next Steps\n\nWith Phase 7 complete, all core requirements of the DSA Learning Platform (Phases 1 through 7) are implemented, integrated, and verified. Would you like to review the UI layout, explore additional problem test cases, or inspect any specific stage?","truncated_fields":["content"]}
